{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58a2c9aa9dc5a833d5102","chatId":"28938ef00f3545f999f8d4c1538203cf","sessionId":null,"userId":94613,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":12588,"promptTokens":2163,"completionTokens":38,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:43:08"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692850428966054,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58a2c9aa9dc5a833d5101","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794476588400,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:43:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58a2c9aa9dc5a833d5101","chatId":"28938ef00f3545f999f8d4c1538203cf","sessionId":null,"userId":94613,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n跃生小时候晚上经常去一个年纪相仿的邻居家玩。某一天玩到深夜，他妈妈临进房间睡觉时，过来跟跃生说，“明天再来玩哈。”跃生觉得受到了邀请，本来第二天不太想找他玩的，为了不辜负这份好意，又勉为其难去他家玩到半夜。他妈妈临进房间睡觉时，又过来跟跃生说，“明天再来玩哈。”\n\n[问题]\n当邻居的妈妈说这句话时，她真正想说的是什么？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 她觉得跃生是个能给她儿子带来乐趣的朋友。\nB. 她暗示跃生应该离开了。\nC. 她希望跃生每天都来她家玩。\nD. 她非常喜欢跃生。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692850428966054,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58a2c9aa9dc5a833d5102","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794476588397,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:43:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9e8fd07a3c944825951bcad43101b65a"}